--- task
id: t35
dataset: section8
kind: write with a computed value

--- intent
It is the birthday of the person with handle `$h`: increase their age by one.

--- params
{"h": "alice"}

--- edition3
query birthday($h: String) {
  $p: Person { handle: $h }
  update $p set { age: $p.age + 1 }
}

--- check
query check($h: String) {
  match { $p: Person { handle: $h } }
  return { $p.age }
}
